{"about_the_game":"The main character is Jane, the young wife of an influential businessman, sent by her husband to another city on his private plane. Her encounter with the pilot, Richard, seems accidental, but the longer the flight lasts, the stronger the attraction between them becomes. The cold atmosphere of luxury gives way to the heat of secret desires, and the exchange of glances turns into a silent confession.<br><br>Now they must decide what is stronger\u2014duty and common sense, or the spark that ignited where there should have been nothing but sky and clouds.<br>At this altitude, it is impossible to lie to oneself.<br><br>Game features:<br><strong>\u2022 A romantic and candid story unfolding on a private jet.<br>\u2022 Tense dynamics between passion and prohibition.<br>\u2022 An atmosphere of seclusion, luxury, and hidden feelings.<br>\u2022 Colorful characters with internal conflicts and secret desires.<br>\u2022 Cinematic presentation that creates a feeling of flight and intimacy. </strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4093340?t=1768548135","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093340/17740083ed646773e3d471b0d7e0dd9a828a12d1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768548135","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093340/fe7b5999577da90cb42e4162cf207ca9fda91277/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768548135","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093340/fe7b5999577da90cb42e4162cf207ca9fda91277/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768548135","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"WARNING!\r\nThis game is for ADULTS only and it includes explicit, sexual content that some viewers may find offensive. The characters shown in the game are all over 18 years old."},"c